==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Espeon}}.
*'''Super Psy Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Super Psy''' on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Kadabra|32}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
**Super Psy Bolt's Japanese name is derived from that of {{m|Confusion}}, a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Espeon}} can learn.

